---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Rules">
	<h1>Rules</h1>
	<p>
		The catalog and individual rule pages aren't generated yet — they'll
		come from <code>RULE_CATALOG.md</code> and <code>RULE_EXAMPLES.md</code>,
